  "sourceText": "Norfolk Style Crab\nBy: Barnaby Dorfman\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound Fresh Crab Meat\n1 stick Butter\n2 tablespoons Cider vinegar\nSalt and pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Heat oven to 400 degrees. In 8 inch pie plate arrange crab meat. Melt butter and add vinegar. Pour over crab. Bake 15 minutes.",
